  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 12 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A9 0C}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}汪！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_450.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3A 01}听{F1 82}说，\n你的名字写作“虎”“狼”“丸”，\n读起来却是“科罗丸”啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_450.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A9 0C}汪。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_450.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}据说虎狼丸先生刚出生时体弱，\n主人希望它能茁壮成长，\n便取了这个名字。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_450.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3F 01}这样啊……\n都说名如其人，\n这份心意一定传达到了吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_450.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A9 0C}汪！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_450.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5E 0B}名如其人……\n是什么意思？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_450.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5B 06}意思是事物或人的名字，\n往往准确地体现其内容或性格。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_450.bf.json:12:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}名字在自我意识形成前就被赋予了。\n反过来说，人是在已有名字的状态下，\n开始萌生自我意识的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_450.bf.json:12:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}因此，逐渐成长为\n名字所蕴含的样子……\n这是完全有可能的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_450.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 68 0B}原来如此……\n就像代表“顺应力”和“平常心”的\n顺平先生一样。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_450.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 03 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 17 09}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}所以说，我的名字不是这么来的啊！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_450.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 87 0B}阳介先生就是阳光的色鬼……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_450.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 03 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 AF 02}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}哪有这么写的啊！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_450.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 78 0B}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}美鹤小姐……\n就是鹤吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
